cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FieldLab, please cite it as below."
title: "iphone-magnetometer (FieldLab): an iPhone magnetometer recorder and stream store"
abstract: >-
  FieldLab streams a stock iPhone's raw magnetometer, device motion and timing to a small server in
  self-describing chunks, keeps them in a durable store, and draws what arrived. It records and does
  not interpret. CardioMag Probe, included, records heartbeat-locked sessions with camera PPG timing.
type: software
